 we receive of him, because we keep his commandments, and do those things that are pleasing in his sight.¦layout ªlast_verse…¤book=§chapter«first_verseªlast_verse¦verses’„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙ‰And this is his commandment, That we should believe on the name of his Son Jesus Christ, and love one another, as he gave us commandment.¦layout ªlast_verse„¥verse¯paragraph_startÂ¥lines‘‚¤textÙ”And he that keepeth his commandments dwelleth in him, and he in him. And hereby we know that he abideth in us, by the Spirit which he hath given us.¦layout ªlast_verse